WEBVTT

00:11:57.704 --> 00:12:03.371
And what he found was that a life
transition begins not with

00:12:03.371 --> 00:12:09.037
a new beginning, like getting a new
job or starting a new school

00:12:09.037 --> 00:12:11.954
or going back to school after a pandemic.

00:12:12.287 --> 00:12:20.162
A life transition begins with an ending
with a sense that something in your mind,

00:12:20.162 --> 00:12:22.621
even if it's not in the external
circumstances,

00:12:22.621 --> 00:12:26.537
has come to a major end point and
you don't know what's next.

00:12:27.454 --> 00:12:33.496
And he then found that the most successful
